      "description": "A widely recognized cultural stereotype portraying stoners as irresponsible, unpredictable, or intrusive, often associated with chaotic behavior such as raiding refrigerators without permission. This stereotype is used humorously in the meme to imply the stoner friend’s behavior is absurd or annoying.",
      "belongsToAnalysis": {
