      "@type": "EmotionExpression",
      "instance_name": "judgmentalness",
      "label": "the judgmental expression",
      "description": "The goat's direct stare, slightly narrowed eyes, and neutral-to-slightly-smirking mouth convey an expression of judgment or disapproval, as if evaluating or criticizing the viewer. This is interpreted as a metaphor for the stoner friend's perceived intrusive or chaotic behavior.",
